IMPORT prelude
DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Buyer, Seller
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF deliver, pay HAS amount IS A NUMBER

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
sale MEANS
    PARTY Seller
    MUST deliver
    WITHIN 14
    HENCE
        PARTY Buyer
        MUST pay 100
        WITHIN 30
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY Buyer BECAUSE "failed to pay"
    LEST BREACH BY Seller BECAUSE "failed to deliver"

#TRACE sale AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Seller DOES deliver AT 10
    PARTY Buyer DOES pay 100 AT 20
#TRACE sale AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Seller DOES deliver AT 10
    PARTY Buyer DOES pay 100 AT 50
#TRACE sale AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Seller DOES deliver AT 10
#EVAL sum (LIST 1,2,3)
#TRACE sale AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Buyer DOES pay 100 AT 5
#TRACE sale AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Buyer DOES pay 100 AT 5
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 20)
#TRACE sale AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Seller DOES deliver AT 14
#TRACE sale AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Seller DOES deliver AT 10
    PARTY Buyer DOES pay 100 AT 40
#TRACE sale AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Seller DOES deliver AT 10
    PARTY Buyer DOES pay 99 AT 20
